Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yawns]\NI'm so hungry!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's this junk?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Chopper squeals]\NWhoa, where did you get that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhh. It wound up in my pocket somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHoly crap! Is it real?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, what is it anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.05,0:01:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2569,3111,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Germa used 'em to do\Nthose cool transformations!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.34,0:01:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! So that's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme me give that thing a quick spin!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.39,0:01:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm goin' before you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.85,0:01:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CHOPPER, LUFFY]\N– Sanji!\N– Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.40,0:01:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna chuck this hunka garbage.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.82,0:01:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy, Chopper gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.40,0:01:32.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NDon't throw it away!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.94,0:01:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIf you do, I'm gonna dive to the\Nbottom of the sea to find it!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.02,0:01:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NGood luck with that! You can't swim!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.57,0:01:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt was in my pocket, so if you don't\Nwant it, just give it back to me instead!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly take it off your hands!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.93,0:01:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.97,0:01:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Chopper, Luffy crying]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.27,0:01:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am rather curious as to how it\Nwandered into Luffy's pocket, somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.89,0:01:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It musta been Niji!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He probably did it to piss me off.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.36,0:02:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna get stronger,\NI won't do it
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by relying on this thing\Nor some technological crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.16,0:02:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just put it down, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.87,0:02:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Science is the power of mankind itself!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.64,0:02:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you guys want it for?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.93,0:02:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(0,981)}[BOTH]\N– If you let us put the raid suit on...\N– If you let us put the raid suit on...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Maybe we can shoot laser beams!\N– Maybe we can shoot laser beams!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.18,0:02:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you guys, ten years old?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.21,0:02:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, Franky's got enough\Nlasers and crap for the whole crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.67,0:02:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNo! I want it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.30,0:02:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that? Did you insult science?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! Why, perish the thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think science is lovely!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.26,0:02:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Sorcerer's Clima Tact was made from\Natmospheric science and the craftsmanship
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.10,0:02:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of our own Usopp, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, out!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.82,0:02:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[giggles]\NI'm really lovin'\Nlife in that baton!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.68,0:02:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NZeus! You actually tagged along?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.77,0:02:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you chose your\Nstomach over loyalty to Big Mom!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[NAMI]\NHe's quite the\Nuseful servant, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.58,0:03:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's your what, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.52,0:03:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Zeus, just so you know,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.44,0:03:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been Nami's devoted servant\Nlong before you showed up, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.61,0:03:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's cute and all,\Nbut I get to live inside her baton,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.07,0:03:13.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which never leaves her side.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Sanji groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.95,0:03:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NSanji, you're yelling\Nat a mass of water vapor.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa! Let's power up!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.61,0:03:23.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CHOPPER, LUFFY]\N– Where the heck's my cool suit?\N– Where the heck's my cool suit?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.65,0:03:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop your crying!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess the thing only works\Nwhen you do it, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm not part of\Nthat goon squad!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.99,0:03:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New rules!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say the word\N"Vinsmoke" or "Germa" either!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.87,0:03:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're officially off limits\Nanytime you're around me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[News Coo A caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.82,0:03:44.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just show us how to do it one\Ntime and we'll leave you alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.70,0:03:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARROT]\NGuys! The newspaper's here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.91,0:03:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIs there any coverage\Nabout us crashing the wedding?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARROT]\NLet's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.61,0:03:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NLuffy's on the front page!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about Jimbei?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.03,0:03:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it say if he\Nmade it out okay, or...?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.24,0:04:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARROT]\NUm, Jimbei, Jimbei.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.62,0:04:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It says Luffy, Sanji, Jimbei,\Nand Bege attempted to assassinate Big Mom,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.63,0:04:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you-teia were the mastermind!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.84,0:04:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Mastermind"?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.38,0:04:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NLook, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SANJI]\NMy bounty increased\Nto 330 million berries?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.77,0:04:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No frickin' way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's Moss-head sitting at?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That should put him\Nright below you now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.39,0:04:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He has a 320 million bounty.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.60,0:04:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHell yeah! In your face, jackass!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just a number, don't flip out.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAnd they change it from "live only"
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,back to "dead or alive"!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NMy name.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.83,0:04:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.44,0:04:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIt changed to "Vinsmoke Sanji"!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.63,0:04:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDammit, it was only increased\Nbecause of my family's reputation.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, buddy? You gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.70,0:05:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NIt's somehow\Neven gloomier over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Luffy! What's the problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.73,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NMeanwhile, everyone is abuzz
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.27,0:05:23.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,about the upcoming Reverie, a conference\Nmade up of all the world's leaders.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.90,0:05:29.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It takes place in the Holy Land\Nof Mary Geoise once every four years.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.14,0:05:34.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThis is Fishman Island, located\N10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.65,0:05:37.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It's home of the Ryugu Kingdom.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NEPTUNE]\NThey did it-jamon!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.82,0:05:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FUKABOSHI]\NJimbei has finally joined Luffy's crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.11,0:05:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Fishmen chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.10,0:05:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NEPTUNE]\NIt's hard to believe that the two of them\Npicked a fight with Big Mom herself.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you suppose they were all\Nable to escape on the same ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.46,0:05:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I certainly hope so-la-ti-do!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Surely they did.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.38,0:06:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the article, it mentions\Nthat Big Mom is furious.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NEPTUNE]\NI don't think Big Mom will be so\Nkeen to protect our country anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.13,0:06:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see if\NStraw Hat will do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't leave yet! Father!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Shirahoshi panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NEPTUNE]\NShirahoshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.35,0:06:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}To the Reverie!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.36,0:06:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If I go, Luffy won't be able to pick\Non me for being a scaredy cat anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.10,0:06:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Neptune laughs]\NI was hoping\Nyou would find the courage.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.85,0:06:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.36,0:06:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.02,0:06:39.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThough the meeting of world\Nleaders is certainly big news,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.52,0:06:43.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,word of Luffy's bold adventures seems\Nto be the only thing on anyone's mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.27,0:06:46.35,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The story about a young pirate\Nwho took a stand against
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.35,0:06:48.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the untouchable Emperor\Nof the Sea, Big Mom,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.49,0:06:51.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,thrills all who hear it,\Nacross the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.83,0:06:53.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The newspaper states:
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"Sources report that Straw Hat Luffy
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,is already in control of\Nseven powerful pirate crews
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.27,0:07:01.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,that he's recruited along the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This makes him the captain of a fleet
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.13,0:07:06.89,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,that has a combined total of\Nover 5,000 fearsome pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.18,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not only the\Nsworn brother of the late Ace,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3003,1150,1,\c&H000000&)}but also Sabo, Second-in-Command\Nof the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,His natural magnetism\Nand leadership skills
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,have drawn the evil army,\NGerma 66, to his side,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.07,0:07:25.41,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3833,0,1,\c&H000000&)}along with the Sun Pirates, and\Nthe Firetank Pirates as well."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.16,0:07:28.32,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\N"His plan to destroy Big Mom's castle
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.32,0:07:31.20,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,can only be seen as a work\Nof strategic brilliance.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.16,0:07:36.54,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Additionally, he defeated her highest-ranked\Nofficers with sheer strength alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.11,0:07:38.69,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The outcome of this battle\Nclearly confirms that
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.69,0:07:41.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is\Na force to be reckoned with."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.06,0:07:45.31,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,And the last line of the article\Nmakes a bold statement.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.99,0:07:49.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,526)}"The fifth Emperor\Nof the Sea has emerged!"
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NAre you kidding?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this "Fifth Emperor" bullcrap?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The press must have\Nlost their damn minds,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.83,0:08:02.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}giving such a lavish title\Nto a little upstart like him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.58,0:08:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral! We have a problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.25,0:08:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Lulucia's ship that was
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.87,0:08:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,en route to the Reverie\Nhas been attacked by pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.02,0:08:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NThe king was unharmed,\Nbut Princess Comane has been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was the point of an armed escort?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REBECCA]\NGrandfather! Grandfather!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DOLDO]\NHm? Rebecca? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.86,0:08:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! The front page!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all about Lucy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DOLDO]\NYes, I saw!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud! That's our captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.83,0:08:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyland is even more famous now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.58,0:08:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And it's kinda cool how the\Nnewspaper mentions all of us, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.65,0:08:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.18,0:08:56.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we arrive, Leo, you cannot\Nbring up such matters.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why can't we, though?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We owe a great debt to the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.20,0:09:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the Government\Nsees them in a different way.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right! They are pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.58,0:09:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is considered\Na dangerous man.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best to avoid trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.87,0:09:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! I should show this to Viola!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEO]\NHey! Wait for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.50,0:09:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NThere's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.30,0:09:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those ships are from the\NDressrosa and Prodence Kingdoms!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And not a Marine in sight!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I-It's Princess Viola!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's just as stunning as they say!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.68,0:09:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The girl she's with is also\Na royal family member, I think?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.01,0:09:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can kidnap these two,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.35,0:09:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much\Nwe get for 'em! [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.07,0:09:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agreed? Princess Comane?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.12,0:09:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, just get ahold\Nof my pa already!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.17,0:09:52.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that he'll be willing\Nto pay you as much as you want!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.63,0:09:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]\NThis is why\NI love nabbing royalty!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold out for a few more.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.27,0:10:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make that ransom real hefty!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A]\NThose suckers can't spot us.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.09,0:10:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can't catch us.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they'll never see us coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.97,0:10:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I love this submarine!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.97,0:10:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D]\NRoger!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Rebecca, Viola gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.62,0:10:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An attack? Ready the cannons!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DRESSROSA SOLDIER F]\NYes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.21,0:10:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NNot necessary.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad I made it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all safe now!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Are you a Marine?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.06,0:11:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A Captain from HQ. I'm Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A]\NDid it miss the target?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.15,0:11:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E]\NThere's no way!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.25,0:11:11.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NDid anyone get hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.31,0:11:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. Your parties are from Dressrosa\Nand Prodence, isn't that correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long way! You must be tired!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.26,0:11:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What just happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.30,0:11:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was patrolling on that Navy ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.74,0:11:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, you folks were being\Nstalked by some pirates just now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,-Underwater. -Under the surface?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it a torpedo?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure glad they missed us.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo. How goes it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.79,0:11:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HELMEPPO]\NWe've got the pirates under control!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.91,0:11:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Lulucia Princess, Comane, is fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[COMANE]\NRoast these bastards on a skewer!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.39,0:12:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You'll suffer!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.48,0:12:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just wait, you monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.85,0:12:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.11,0:12:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We'll handle them. Easy now!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.03,0:12:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still don't get how your Observation\NHaki is so in tune, Koby. Crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.03,0:12:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to sense\Nthe torpedo at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.73,0:12:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VIOLA]\NA submarine?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.19,0:12:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DOLDO]\NYou have to be careful\Nwith pirates these days.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a bit too close.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.65,0:12:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.82,0:12:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Koby gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KYROS]\NThe famous Captain Koby, I presume?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? So is he the one from Rocky Port?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were the Marine\Nfrom the incident?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.62,0:12:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one perpetrated by Trafalgar\NLaw of the Worst Generation?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This hero protected all those people!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm hardly a hero. It's nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're not only daring.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're humble, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.82,0:12:51.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NWow. This guy looks tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KYROS]\NWhat a fine lad.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.54,0:12:55.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If only he could take a compliment.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REBECCA]\NThank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.68,0:12:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.68,0:13:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy? No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,-[REBECCA] Huh? -[KOBY] Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.05,0:13:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just noticed the headline\Nin the newspaper you're holding!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NNo, no!\NWell, I mean, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,"The Fifth Emperor of\Nthe Sea has emerged!"
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of him!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.23,0:13:22.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.44,0:13:25.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NHe keeps reaching higher and higher.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh? Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NEvery time I see you in the newspaper,\NI think back to that day.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.96,0:13:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE A]\NCaptain Koby! What're you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.04,0:13:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on back!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.50,0:13:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NYes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.71,0:13:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I appreciate it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.09,0:13:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're nearly to New Marineford.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.83,0:14:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy would be happy to escort\Nyou the rest of the way there.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.43,0:14:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good. Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.50,0:14:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REBECCA]\NPsst. Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.84,0:14:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucy's your friend, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby! You like Luffyland?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.02,0:14:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! He's a foe!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we won't tell.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we should have a little talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NI'm a Navy Officer!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.70,0:14:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-And I need to get going!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.28,0:14:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEO]\NBut you looked so happy when\Nyou were reading the paper.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NTh-That's because I, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.29,0:14:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REBECCA]\NCome on. Let's talk!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.46,0:14:32.92,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY]\NNo! Please stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.92,0:14:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LEO]\NOh, Luffyland's in this article, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REBECCA]\NSo you are his friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.17,0:14:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Rebecca giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.78,0:14:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Sanji groans]\NDamn. My bounty only increased
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bad rep.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.54,0:14:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That takes all the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.84,0:15:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, are you in pain?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.14,0:15:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NN-No, it's just. Look.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.18,0:15:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMy bounty's gone down!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.02,0:15:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'see?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 150 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.14,0:15:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.22,0:15:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it 500? A while back?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That went down by a whole lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.81,0:15:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's even lower than\Nit was two years ago!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NHow is that possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.32,0:15:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you do something wrong, perhaps?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that backwards?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.08,0:15:36.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NAh, yes. You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.98,0:15:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No biggie!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Less people will be\Nafter your head now!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNami, how could you say that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.40,0:15:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is our captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could harm our prestige!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.24,0:15:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDammit! Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE A]\NReady the cannons! And fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirate A laughs]\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.27,0:16:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.65,0:16:04.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE A]\NGrab anything not tied down!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is the Navy doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought they were here to protect us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for destroying our ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.95,0:16:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.01,0:16:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.47,0:16:26.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard laughs]\NThe Navy's just a joke!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.89,0:16:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.19,0:16:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Lulucia King is\Naway for the Reverie,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.57,0:16:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he took all his\Nbest soldiers with him!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.49,0:16:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For pirates like me, an unguarded country\Nlike this is ripe for the picking.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NNow listen up, and listen well!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.35,0:16:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Have you ever heard of the Emperor\Nof the Sea "Blackbeard"?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.87,0:16:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I work under him, and I've\Ntaken on the name "Peachbeard."
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.79,0:16:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You would do well to remember it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fear Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.80,0:17:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start loading up the ships\Nand make our leader proud, shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.64,0:17:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Peachbeard Pirates yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.64,0:17:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]\NGotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now empty those pockets!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.84,0:17:14.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Just get off of me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.96,0:17:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.88,0:17:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll burn this whole place down!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.01,0:17:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townsperson B screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townsperson D gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.73,0:17:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON E]\NCan you stand?\NLet's get you out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.77,0:17:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, you better not\Nlet that girl escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.57,0:17:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE F]\NNot so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.90,0:17:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Moda gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.70,0:17:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NWhat's that you got there, missy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now what in the world\Ncould be so precious
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that you would dare\Ntry and hide it from me?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.47,0:17:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NSorry, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.42,0:17:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that milk?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be money.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No big deal, I'll take it anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.80,0:18:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, mister. This is for\Nthe children of the village.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, shut it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.88,0:18:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.51,0:18:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really willing to\Nrisk your life for some milk?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MODA]\NPlease give it back to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.47,0:18:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.01,0:18:19.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but we need it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.27,0:18:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NHuh? Why don't you\Nhand over your money, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NI don't have any.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you have your\Nheavenly tribute, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.61,0:18:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NYes, but the heavenly tribute
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.99,0:18:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is what we have to pay to the\Nking and the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're barely getting by as-is.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.62,0:18:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It takes every last berry\Nwe can scrape together.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.92,0:18:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't pay the Heavenly\NTribute, we'll be put to death!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.17,0:18:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a shame.\NYour king sounds terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fellas know what to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.54,0:18:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rip this town apart, and find\Nwhere they hid the money!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Peachbeard Pirate F laughs]\NIt's gotta be somewhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}-We're gonna be rich! -Please don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.45,0:19:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us. Where's the\NTribute stashed away?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.27,0:19:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone.\NOur town has nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON G]\NPlease don't take this\Nmoney, it's all I have!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.63,0:19:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get your grubby hands off!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.47,0:19:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.25,0:19:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have gotten beaten\Nif you gave us what we wanted!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.59,0:19:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NKill everyone who disobeys!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.80,0:19:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates cackle]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MODA]\NWe've suffered enough.\NPlease, leave our people alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.90,0:19:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.51,0:19:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Morley. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NHm? And just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is the ground shaking?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.53,0:19:46.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.03,0:19:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE K]\NSomething is coming up from the street?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.66,0:20:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's a huge-ass trident here?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NHm? Is that a Giant?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MORLEY]\NOne, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.19,0:20:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.45,0:20:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE N]\NWhat the hell was this\Nhuge guy doing underground?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.03,0:20:31.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE O]\NThat's, uh, some outfit, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE P]\NUh. Why is he wearing a miniskirt?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.29,0:20:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.04,0:20:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be a creep!\NWatch where you're lookin'!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.91,0:20:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, my eyes are up here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.75,0:20:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're that into me,\Nthen just say it, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.08,0:20:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that idea?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.34,0:20:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are some mighty\Ntall accusations there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.37,0:20:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shoot this guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You little boys should leave me alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON I]\NSo, since when\Ndo Giants live underground?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.76,0:21:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder who this guy is.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.47,0:21:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big old meanies like you\Nwill be punished!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.82,0:21:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is this guy pushing\Nthe road around like it's clay?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.70,0:21:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down!\NIt's only a devil fruit!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's so tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BELO BETTY]\NSo. What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.13,0:21:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPEOPLE]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BELO BETTY]\NYou submissive pieces of trash.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's rude.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.47,0:21:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.76,0:21:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MODA]\NExcuse me! Who are you people,\Nand what do you want with our town?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.94,0:21:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Morley!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.45,0:21:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't have all the fun without me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MORLEY]\NWhat do you want?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.60,0:22:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.85,0:22:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got some newly-invented\Nweapons to try.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.06,0:22:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you run out ahead, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are these circus monkeys?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.78,0:22:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[crows cawing]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's a murder of crows here?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE T]\NCaptain!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.86,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! Someone's on the roof!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are the birds gathering up?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.90,0:22:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KARASU]\NHow dare you attempt\Nto harm the innocent.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.98,0:22:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NCaptain Peachbeard, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.02,0:22:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't be here!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,148)}They're supposed to be\Nscattered across the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.39,0:22:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,144)}They're the four captains\Nof the Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.57,0:22:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. No way. They're what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.98,0:23:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Knock it off.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.15,0:23:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're still staring!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.53,0:23:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are y'scared yet? Scumbag.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.24,0:23:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm dying to try my new weapons on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.91,0:23:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KARASU]\NWe won't allow you to do as you please.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.79,0:23:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Revolutionaries? Are they here to help?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.99,0:23:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Straw Boy really is\Nsomething else, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.83,0:23:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I guess the apple doesn't\Nfall too far from the tree!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.17,0:23:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.67,0:23:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knew that young buck Sanji\Nwas Germa 66's prince!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.84,0:23:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How insolent!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.97,0:23:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't even mention it to me once.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.02,0:23:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It pisses me off.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.94,0:23:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a result of that\NWhole Cake incident,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.73,0:23:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa's been booted from\Nthe World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.83,0:23:54.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, my, Straw Boy and Sanji Boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.20,0:23:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just as I expected, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.54,0:24:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're becoming the center\Nof attention in the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.96,0:24:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm excited to see where this goes!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.26,0:24:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Anyway, our officers are\Nrunning kinda late, aren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.63,0:24:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hopefully, they didn't get held\Nup too bad on their way here.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.30,0:24:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.39,0:24:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sabo.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.89,0:24:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatcha got going on\Nover there, honey-pie?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.47,0:24:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.81,0:24:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your face is cramping\Nbecause you keep smiling
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.43,0:24:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,every time you think of\Nthe Luffy news, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.56,0:24:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[IVANKOV]\NYou boob!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.35,0:24:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ringing]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.81,0:24:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.27,0:24:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH]\NHello, Lindbergh here!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.86,0:24:34.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are really late.\NWhat's the hold up?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.20,0:24:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH]\NOh, hey Sabo! We are almost there.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ran into some trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.87,0:24:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you guys mind if we're a bit late?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.07,0:24:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem. Just stay safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.95,0:24:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]\NCu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.00,0:24:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I am absolutely thrilled!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.21,0:24:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the Revolutionary Army's best\Nwill be here in the flesh at long last!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.26,0:24:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'll\Nget to chat with Morley!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.93,0:24:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares! It's all about Betty!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.02,0:24:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo. We've wasted enough time.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.93,0:25:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should hold our meeting now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.68,0:25:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might as well solidify\Nour plan before they arrive.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.93,0:25:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're up.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.10,0:25:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Second-in-Command.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.48,0:25:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SABO]\NYup.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.23,0:25:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With the Reverie just round the corner,\Nwe'll finally take action.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.11,0:25:17.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We will be declaring war.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.37,0:25:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}On the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.36,0:25:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.41,0:25:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all so powerful.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.57,0:25:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.94,0:25:33.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are four top officers\Nneeded to defend one town?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.27,0:25:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez! This guy is so dense!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.69,0:25:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BELO BETTY]\NHe only wants you\Nfor your body, obviously.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ew, yuck! No thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.37,0:25:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I checked in\Nwith Sabo like you asked.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.91,0:25:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we do this now, Betty?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.75,0:25:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KARASU]\NYou're powerless to stop us.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.86,0:25:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is no one answering the question?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.95,0:25:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what is he mumbling about anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.99,0:25:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KARASU]\NI've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.44,0:25:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did this guy just snap?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.90,0:26:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you pieces of crap! Ya gonna help?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.75,0:26:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you die? Or will you fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.42,0:26:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to choose your destiny!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.59,0:26:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.80,0:26:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is playing hero someone else's job?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.11,0:26:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to cower in fear?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.20,0:26:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.73,0:26:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NDo you really think\Na couple of sticks
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.08,0:26:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are gonna stop us?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.30,0:26:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are cracking me up.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.18,0:26:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this, a peasant uprising?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.55,0:26:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why. But all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.72,0:26:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel this huge surge\Nof power inside me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.42,0:26:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's force\Nthese pirates to leave!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.13,0:26:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should fight and\Nprotect our kingdom!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.30,0:27:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPEOPLE]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.34,0:27:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MORLEY]\NThat's the stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.88,0:27:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're feeling the raw power\Nof Betty's Pump-Pump Fruit!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.97,0:27:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With a mere wave of her banner,\Nshe can call forth the strength within you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.56,0:27:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Betty is a flag-bearer of freedom!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.85,0:27:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.98,0:27:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.68,0:27:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess they wanna see\Nwhat bullets do to their bodies.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.95,0:27:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't know what they're in for!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.00,0:27:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Morley grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Lind, Karasu! Go and back them up!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.92,0:27:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you wish! Now freeze!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.68,0:27:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cool Shooter! [cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.97,0:27:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's freezing!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.93,0:27:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My gun got all iced up!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.80,0:27:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack us, you bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.06,0:27:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Rip 'em to shreds!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.52,0:27:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KARASU]\NDisarm them!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.32,0:27:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard Pirates gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.78,0:27:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE AD]\NThat big bird stole our swords!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.74,0:28:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE AE]\NCome back!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.29,0:28:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.75,0:28:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seize your own fate!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.46,0:28:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.54,0:28:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rot in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.73,0:28:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD]\NWhat is this? Why are they fired up?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.48,0:28:20.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk! This is for the milk!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.36,0:28:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Belo Betty grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.24,0:28:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Peachbeard screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.53,0:28:46.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE AJ]\NWe're outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.95,0:28:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEACHBEARD PIRATE AK]\NWe'll make you pay for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.14,0:28:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BELO BETTY]\NPeachbeard. 52 million berries, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.01,0:28:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Blackbeard will avenge\Nme, then you'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.77,0:29:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but he\Ndoesn't give a crap about his thugs.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.23,0:29:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man. What's your problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.15,0:29:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.61,0:29:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH]\NAgreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.90,0:29:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.19,0:29:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pathetic, yellow-bellied,\Nweak sad sacks!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.61,0:29:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.27,0:29:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All y'gotta do is give him\Nto the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.16,0:29:19.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that sweet bounty will be yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.70,0:29:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would be a total of\N52 million berries.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.17,0:29:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So. Make sure to use it wisely.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.25,0:29:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.66,0:29:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here. I want you to have this.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.33,0:29:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BELO BETTY]\NYou can use it to\Ncontact the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.18,0:29:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all made me proud today.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.60,0:29:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hit us up anytime.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.81,0:29:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the weak stand up for themselves,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.10,0:29:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we will always be close behind\Nand ready to fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.28,0:29:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.52,0:30:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Belo Betty rocks!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.35,0:30:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.97,0:30:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget what you've done!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.53,0:30:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.19,0:30:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What exactly's the reason we're\Nmeeting up with everyone anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.91,0:30:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be pickin' a fight\Nwith the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.49,0:30:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LINDBERGH]\NOh, now that sounds like a good time!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.75,0:30:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.04,0:30:36.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. One thing, Karasu!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.46,0:30:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to turn up your loudspeaker.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.95,0:30:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KARASU]\NSorry. Forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.62,0:30:49.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NOnly two days remain until the Reverie,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.49,0:30:54.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the schemes of players from\Naround the world begin to intertwine.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.54,0:30:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOALA]\NOkay. Roger that.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.55,0:30:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have an update for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.65,0:31:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo? They'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.15,0:31:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SABO]\NAll right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.98,0:31:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NWhat is this crap?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.48,0:31:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I've seen this stupid face before!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.40,0:31:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the same guy who screwed\Nover my entire SMILE production!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.41,0:31:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How in the hell did he manage\Nto take down that old bag?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.68,0:31:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NIt says "he won"? What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.96,0:31:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did I lose, and to whom?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.30,0:31:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I know who wrote\Nthis slanderous article, Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.72,0:31:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NI do, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.49,0:31:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to teach Morgans a lesson.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.85,0:31:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NBut Straw Hat, you're first!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.98,0:31:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be coming for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.35,0:31:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Teach chuckles]\NThe Fifth Emperor?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:59.44,0:32:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now that title doesn't fit you at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.41,0:32:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Teach cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.66,0:32:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NLooks like I'll be seeing you soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.71,0:32:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.18,0:32:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy crying]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.06,0:32:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what if it got lower?\NWe can't do anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.39,0:32:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou'll get up there again, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.40,0:32:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I got your back!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.19,0:32:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get it even higher!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:36.65,0:32:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya hungry? I'll make lunch.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.12,0:32:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NUh. Just a moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.68,0:32:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.89,0:33:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NLook. I believe you\Nmissed a few zeros here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:00.17,0:33:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:04.80,0:33:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NYour bounty's not 150 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:08.05,0:33:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.18,0:33:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NIt's 1.5 billion!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.97,0:33:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[all scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NWhile the rest of the world\Nlooks toward the Reverie,
Dialogue: 50,0:33:23.36,0:33:25.69,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats embark\Nto the Land of Wano.
